				},
				{
					"id": 205130304,
					"content": "哈哈哈，不知道为什么，我有一种这副药吃下去，安娜的病就会好起来的感觉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205130305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205130305,
					"content": "也许是因为安娜的身体突然有了起色，我乐观过头了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205130306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205130306,
					"content": "总之，辛苦你了，这些是给你的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205130307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205130307,
					"content": "希望安娜能好起来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205130308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205130308,
					"content": "谢谢你，她一定会好起来的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205130309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安东尼"
				},
